<title>BELGIUM: EU molasses import duties remain suspended.</title>
<headline>EU molasses import duties remain suspended.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-07-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>European Union duties on imports of molasses will remain suspended for a further week until July 16, EU officials said.</p>
<p>The cif reference price for imports of cane molasses was set at 8.35 ecus per 100 kg, against 8.32 ecus previously.</p>
<p>The cif reference price for beet molasses was set at 12.29 ecus per 100 kg, against 12.25 ecus the previous week.</p>
